OL,3,GNEWSASkip operator who mismanaged waste
OL,4,Asite sentenced
OL,5,
OL,6,FA skip hire operator who admitted
OL,7,Fmismanagement of a waste facility that
OL,8,Fled to a large fire has been sentenced.
OL,10,FA hearing was told Paul Sellars had
OL,11,Fshown a flagrant disregard for the law
OL,12,Fby taking waste and not storing it
OL,13,Fsafely at the site in Wood Lane, in
OL,14,FGreetham, Rutland, between October 2023
OL,15,Fand August 2024, the Environment Agency
OL,16,Fsaid.
OL,18,FConcerns over the volume of waste at
OL,19,Fthe site were raised, with the blaze
OL,20,Fbreaking out a day after a suspension
OL,21,Forder was imposed.
OL,23,APub: 03-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
