OL,3,GNEWSASkip operator who mismanaged waste
OL,4,Asite sentenced
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe 65-year-old, of Wheatsheaf Lane, in
OL,7,FGreetham, was handed a 14-week prison
OL,8,Fsentence, suspended for two years, at
OL,9,FLeicester Magistrates' Court on
OL,10,FThursday.
